      "extract_value": "This section describes use of the Body Appreciation Scale-2 (BAS-2) to assess body appreciation, noting it is a 10-item scale scored as the mean of items. It reports internal consistency in the present study with Cronbach's \u03b1 = .95 in women and .93 in men and references prior evidence for BAS-2 psychometrics in college and community U.S. samples. No sample size, demographics, BMI assessment, survey method, or correlations with BMI are provided in this section.",
